    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Super Hard Game&quot; is a brutally difficult top-down arcade game where even a single mistake means game over.</strong> <br>Play as \u201cDalddo,\u201d a moon rabbit trying to escape to Earth, while dodging unpredictable threats like missiles, lasers, and massive spaceships. Despite its cute appearance, this is a pure reaction-based skill game that demands sharp focus and lightning-fast decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>simple controls and randomly generated threats</strong>, every attempt feels fresh. Missiles spawn dynamically, meaning there's no fixed pattern\u2014you\u2019ll have to rely on quick reflexes and adaptation rather than memorization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime depends on your skill and determination.</strong><br>Some players may breeze through stages quickly, but for most, it will take multiple attempts to hone their reactions and clear the escalating challenges.<br><br>Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-hit failure: the ultimate test of skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls anyone can pick up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized missile attacks</strong> for ever-changing challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique, handcrafted stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute yet brutally unforgiving experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay that rewards focus, fast reactions, and grit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game to flex your skills\u2014or laugh at your friends trying</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Super Hard Game&quot; is a brutally difficult top-down arcade game where even a single mistake means game over.</strong> <br>Play as \u201cDalddo,\u201d a moon rabbit trying to escape to Earth, while dodging unpredictable threats like missiles, lasers, and massive spaceships. Despite its cute appearance, this is a pure reaction-based skill game that demands sharp focus and lightning-fast decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>simple controls and randomly generated threats</strong>, every attempt feels fresh. Missiles spawn dynamically, meaning there's no fixed pattern\u2014you\u2019ll have to rely on quick reflexes and adaptation rather than memorization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime depends on your skill and determination.</strong><br>Some players may breeze through stages quickly, but for most, it will take multiple attempts to hone their reactions and clear the escalating challenges.<br><br>Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-hit failure: the ultimate test of skill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls anyone can pick up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized missile attacks</strong> for ever-changing challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 unique, handcrafted stages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cute yet brutally unforgiving experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay that rewards focus, fast reactions, and grit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game to flex your skills\u2014or laugh at your friends trying</p></li></ul>",
